<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>{{ $reference }}</title><style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;line-height:1.6;margin:48px auto;max-width:820px;padding:0 32px}header{text-align:center;border-bottom:2px solid #0f766e;padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:36px}.logo{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1d4ed8}.meta{color:#555;font-size:13px}h1{font-size:22px;text-align:center;margin:30px 0}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:24px 0}td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:10px}td:first-child{font-weight:700;width:35%;background:#f8fafc}.signature{margin-top:70px}@media print{body{margin:0;max-width:none}.print{display:none}}</style></head><body><header><div class="logo">PractiLink</div><div>Practical Training Placement Management</div><div class="meta">Placement Letter · Version {{ $version }}</div></header><div class="meta">Reference: <strong>{{ $reference }}</strong><br>Issued: {{ now()->format('d M Y') }}</div><h1>PLACEMENT LETTER</h1><p>To whom it may concern,</p><p>This letter confirms that <strong>{{ $placement->student->full_name }}</strong>, registration number <strong>{{ $placement->student->registration_number }}</strong>, has been allocated practical training placement as part of {{ $placement->application->applicationWindow->trainingType->name }}.</p><table><tr><td>Host organization</td><td>{{ $placement->organization->name }}</td></tr><tr><td>Department</td><td>{{ $placement->department?->name ?? 'To be assigned' }}</td></tr><tr><td>Training period</td><td>{{ $placement->start_date->format('d M Y') }} to {{ $placement->end_date->format('d M Y') }}</td></tr><tr><td>Location</td><td>{{ $placement->location ?? 'As arranged with host organization' }}</td></tr><tr><td>Supervisor</td><td>{{ $placement->supervisor?->name ?? 'To be assigned' }}</td></tr></table><p>The student is expected to comply with the rules, policies and professional requirements of the host organization throughout the training period.</p><div class="signature"><strong>Authorized Placement Officer</strong><br>PractiLink</div><button class="print" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button></body></html>
